James received an email from Md. Nazmus Sakib, a prospective graduate student interested in pursuing an MS/Ph.D. in Oceanography at the University of Delaware, starting Fall 2027. Nazmus detailed his impressive academic background and research experiences, highlighting his alignment with James's work on climate change modeling. In response, James drafted a professional email declining to accept new students for that semester. The main outcome was a clear and polite refusal of the application, reflecting James's current capacity.
